# HOMEOS — AI-POWERED DIGITAL HOME TWIN

### **“Your home remembers. You just live in it.”**

---

# 1. THE IDEA IN ONE LINE

**HomeOS is an AI-powered Digital Home Twin that remembers and understands everything important about a household — bills, documents, appliances, warranties, maintenance, insurance and recurring obligations — and proactively tells the family what needs attention.**

The goal is NOT to build another property-management app.

The goal is:

> **“Make everyday household management effortless by giving the home a digital memory.”**

---

# 2. WHY WE CHANGED / NARROWED THE IDEA

Our original HomeOS concept was broader:

* Property documents
* Property management
* Rental management
* Property expenses
* Property valuation
* Government records
* Insurance
* PF/EPF
* Family financial access
* Emergency/legacy mode
* AI assistant

These are all useful, but there was a major problem:

### If we try to solve everything, HomeOS becomes just another feature-heavy app.

For a hackathon/product, we need to identify a **small problem with a huge user base and everyday relevance.**

So we asked:

> **What problem does almost every household have, regardless of whether they are rich, middle-class or poor?**

The answer:

# **People forget things about their home.**

They forget:

* When the AC was last serviced
* When the insurance expires
* When the electricity bill is due
* When the RO filter needs replacement
* When an appliance warranty ends
* Where an important document is
* How much they spent on repairs
* When the rental agreement expires
* When property tax is due
* Which technician repaired something last time
* Which documents belong to which property

These are small problems individually.

But they happen repeatedly to millions of households.

